","chapter_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:p005","quote":"繇王"}],"family_path":{"connection":"grandfather","generation_distance":2,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue","source_id":"s-shiji114-dongyue","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:p004","quote":"至建元六年，閩越擊南越。南越守天子約，不敢擅發兵擊而以聞。上遣大行王恢出豫章，大農韓安國出會稽，皆為將軍。兵未踰嶺，閩越王郢發兵距險。其弟餘善乃與相、宗族謀曰：「王以擅發兵擊南越，不請，故天子兵來誅。今漢兵眾彊，今即幸勝之，后來益多，終滅國而止。今殺王以謝天子。天子聽，罷兵，固一國完；不聽，乃力戰；不勝，即亡入海。」皆曰「善」。即鏦殺王，使使奉其頭致大行。大行曰：「所為來者誅王。今王頭至，謝罪，不戰而耘，利莫大焉。」乃以便宜案兵告大農軍，而使使奉王頭馳報天子。詔罷兩將兵，曰：「郢等首惡，獨無諸孫繇君丑不與謀焉。」乃使郎中將立丑為越繇王，奉閩越先祭祀。"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji114-004","interpretation_note":"分支字元不表排行，依明示父系記載接線；未名世代以星號留空。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","ancestor_person_id":"e00_pe1_zri","parent_person_id":null,"intermediate_person_ids":[null]}},{"id":"i7a_22p_qda","label":"句踐","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"越王句踐","mention_ids":["c-shiji-031-wu:m031-0009","c-shiji-031-wu:m032-0048","c-shiji-031-wu:m033-0035","c-shiji-031-wu:m034-0033","c-shiji-031-wu:m037-0028","c-shiji-031-wu:m039-0008","c-shiji-031-wu:m040-0004","c-shiji-031-wu:m040-0035","c-shiji-033-lu:m088-0005","c-shiji-036-chenqi:m032-0087","c-shiji-040-chu:m052-0032"]},{"surface":"句踐","mention_ids":["c-shiji-031-wu:m031-0087","c-shiji-031-wu:m032-0231","c-shiji-031-wu:m032-0257","c-shiji-036-chenqi:m033-0068","c-shiji-041-yue:m001-0002","c-shiji-041-yue:m001-0079","c-shiji-041-yue:m002-0020","c-shiji-041-yue:m003-0003","c-shiji-041-yue:m004-0064","c-shiji-041-yue:m004-0093","c-shiji-041-yue:m004-0105","c-shiji-041-yue:m004-0147","c-shiji-041-yue:m004-0150","c-shiji-041-yue:m004-0168","c-shiji-041-yue:m004-0194","c-shiji-041-yue:m004-0233","c-shiji-041-yue:m004-0249","c-shiji-041-yue:m004-0325","c-shiji-041-yue:m005-0000","c-shiji-041-yue:m006-0007","c-shiji-041-yue:m007-0000","c-shiji-041-yue:m007-0153","c-shiji-041-yue:m008-0021","c-shiji-041-yue:m009-0004","c-shiji-041-yue: