:"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m001-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"句踐","kind":"person","person_id":"i7a_22p_qda","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m001-0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"無諸","kind":"person","person_id":"e00_pe1_zri","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m001-0057","start":57,"end":58,"surface":"搖","kind":"person","person_id":"ub6_g9c_hvb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m001-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"吳芮","kind":"person","person_id":"o0l_em5_5v9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m001-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"鄱君","kind":"person","person_id":"o0l_em5_5v9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m001-0085","start":85,"end":87,"surface":"項籍","kind":"person","person_id":"ob7_g6i_7pp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m001-0101","start":101,"end":103,"surface":"項籍","kind":"person","person_id":"ob7_g6i_7pp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m001-0104","start":104,"end":106,"surface":"無諸","kind":"person","person_id":"e00_pe1_zri","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m001-0107","start":107,"end":108,"surface":"搖","kind":"person","person_id":"ub6_g9c_hvb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m001-0120","start":120,"end":122,"surface":"無諸","kind":"person","person_id":"e00_pe1_zri","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m001-0137","start":137,"end":139,"surface":"孝惠","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m001-0143","start":143,"end":145,"surface":"高帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m001-0152","start":152,"end":153,"surface":"搖","kind":"person","person_id":"ub6_g9c_hvb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m001-0163","start":163,"end":164,"surface":"搖","kind":"person","person_id":"ub6_g9c_hvb","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue","book_id":"b-shiji-114","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji114-dongyue"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:p004","text":"至建元六年，閩越擊南越。南越守天子約，不敢擅發兵擊而以聞。上遣大行王恢出豫章，大農韓安國出會稽，皆為將軍。兵未踰嶺，閩越王郢發兵距險。其弟餘善乃與相、宗族謀曰：「王以擅發兵擊南越，不請，故天子兵來誅。今漢兵眾彊，今即幸勝之，后來益多，終滅國而止。今殺王以謝天子。天子聽，罷兵，固一國完；不聽，乃力戰；不勝，即亡入海。」皆曰「善」。即鏦殺王，使使奉其頭致大行。大行曰：「所為來者誅王。今王頭至，謝罪，不戰而耘，利莫大焉。」乃以便宜案兵告大農軍，而使使奉王頭馳報天子。詔罷兩將兵，曰：「郢等首惡，獨無諸孫繇君丑不與謀焉。」乃使郎中將立丑為越繇王，奉閩越先祭祀。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m004-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m004-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"王恢","kind":"person","person_id":"z2v_oh4_mhm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m004-0041","start":41,"end":44,"surface":"韓安國","kind":"person","person_id":"6hy_i1z_hu2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m004-0061","start":61,"end":62,"surface":"郢","kind":"person","person_id":"xp5_39k_w5w","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m004-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"餘善","kind":"person","person_id":"ub3_zen_skw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m004-0073","start":73,"end":74,"surface":"相","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m004-0075","start":75,"end":77,"surface":"宗族","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m004-0081","start":81,"end":82,"surface":"王","person_id":"xp5_39k_w5w","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m004-0094","start":94,"end":96,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-114-